 "text": "**Digest 2026-10-15 UTC** · #cd-tracker (dev, 231 tickets) · since 2026-10-15\n\n**Summary**\n• Kernel v3 built (BLD-16): the engine cache rebuilds all 1,250 v2 dev ledgers hash-for-hash, so a dev experiment takes ~10 s per family instead of 30-70 min; cross-machine hashes need OpenBLAS pinned (CAP-11)\n• Missed links (TGT-19): every link-recovery lever failed on dev (recovered links 33% precise; GES penalty 0.5 lowers F1). Floor measured: 9.0% / 6.8% of true links carry no usable signal; 14% / 20% are a search gap\n• ER-2, second held-out read (TGT-18): met for formula (0.908 [0.876]; pooled 0.911 [0.863]); not met for semantic (0.830 [0.783]; pooled 0.866 [0.799], short by 0.001)\n• CAP-07: held-out ECE 0.021 / 0.025 (v2 0.057 / 0.036); ER-3 still not met, upper ends 0.051-0.074 on 25 scenarios\n• Open choice for Uzair: more scenarios to narrow every interval, or a v4 on the semantic search gap / direction evidence beyond GES (TGT-19)\n\n**Done** (1)\n• ✅ BLD-16 Kernel v3: engine cache, direction view, ledger-feature confidence, pooled-replicates…\n\n**New** (1)\n• ✅ BLD-16 Kernel v3: engine cache, direction view, ledger-feature confidence, pooled-replicates…\n\n**Due in the next 14 days**\n• 2026-10-16 CRS-07 Decision gate G1\n• 2026-10-19 CRS-01 TA check-in 1 (TA: Nate)\n• 2026-10-20 BND-03 Paper and code audit: headline claims, methods text, untouched modules…\n• 2026-10-22 BND-02 Primary sources: literature re-reads, deep reads, method choices\n• 2026-10-24 BND-06 Remaining baselines, order sensitivity, scoreboard package (no LLM)\n\nTotals: ✅ 146 · 👀 18 · ⏳ 40 · 🔴 1 · 🔵 26",
